---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Hamad" description="About Hamad Lorem Ipsum">
	<div class="stack gap-20">
		<main class="wrapper about">
			<Hero
				title="About"
				tagline="Thanks for stopping by. Read below to learn more about myself and my background."
			>
				<img
					width="350"
					height="350"
					src="/assets/portrait.jpeg"
					alt="Hamad"
				/>
			</Hero>

			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Background</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>
						My journey in technology began at a young age, fueled by an insatiable curiosity about how
						computers work. I remember my first encounter with programming, typing simple BASIC programs
						into my family's computer, fascinated by how lines of code could create interactive
						experiences. This early exposure sparked a lifelong passion for technology that has only
						grown stronger over the years.
					</p>
					<p>
						My love for Linux emerged when I discovered the power and flexibility of open-source
						software. I was captivated by the philosophy of free and open collaboration, which led me to
						dive deep into various Linux distributions. What started as casual exploration turned into a
						professional pursuit as I became proficient in system administration, shell scripting, and
						optimizing Linux environments for performance and security.
					</p>
					<p>
						Throughout my journey, I've embraced the challenge of solving complex problems through code. From building my first websites to developing more sophisticated applications, I've always been driven by the thrill of turning ideas into reality. The ever-evolving nature of technology keeps me constantly learning and adapting, whether it's exploring new programming paradigms, contributing to open-source projects, or experimenting with emerging technologies.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Education</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>
						I hold a Bachelor of Science in Creative Computing from the Bath Spa University, where I
						developed a solid foundation in programming, algorithms, and software development practices.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Skills</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>
						I have a strong foundation in web development, with expertise in modern frameworks like React and Next.js, along with core technologies including HTML, CSS, and JavaScript/TypeScript. I'm passionate about creating responsive and performant user interfaces, often leveraging Tailwind CSS for efficient styling. Beyond web technologies, I enjoy exploring systems programming with Rust, appreciating its performance and safety guarantees. I'm always excited to learn and adopt new tools and technologies that can help build better software.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<ContactCTA />
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.about {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3.5rem;
	}

	img {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
		align-self: center;
	}

	section {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--gray-200);
	}

	.section-title {
		grid-column-start: 1;
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		color: var(--gray-0);
	}

	.content {
		grid-column: 2 / 4;
	}

	.content :global(a) {
		text-decoration: 1px solid underline transparent;
		text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
		transition: text-decoration-color var(--theme-transition);
	}

	.content :global(a:hover),
	.content :global(a:focus) {
		text-decoration-color: currentColor;
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.about {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 60% 1fr;
		}

		.about > :global(:first-child) {
			grid-column-start: 2;
		}

		section {
			display: contents;
			font-size: var(--text-lg);
		}
	}
</style>
